Given an authenticated User
And a Company to which the User has no active relationship
When the User attempts to access that Company
Then the API rejects the request
And the response uses the standardized error format
Scenario 13 — Soft Delete
Given an active Company
When the Company is deleted
Then deleted_at is populated
And the Company is excluded from active Company listings
And the Company remains persisted
Scenario 14 — Flat JSON
Given an authenticated User
When the User submits Company attributes in flat JSON
And the request uses the configured parameter wrapping behavior
Then the Company attributes are correctly interpreted
